  solution_summary: |
    합: n(A△B)+n(B△C)+n(C△A) = 2[Σn]-2[pairwise sum].
    45+47+42=134 → Σn - pairwise = 67.
    n(A∪B∪C) = Σn - pairwise + triple = 67 + triple = 75.
    triple = 8.
  category: 삼집합·대칭차
  tier: star_5
